            <ArticleTitle>Walls and Barriers. Polish Achievements and the Challenges of Transformation: Building a Hospice Movement in Poland.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>600-604</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
